        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jorge Dorado\n- Films: La guerra, Nuevos tiempos, Mindscape, Anna\n- Awards: Goya Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jorge Dorado received Goya Award nominations for the short film \"La guerra\" and the documentary short \"Nuevos tiempos\".\n- In 2013, \"Mindscape\" was released as an internationally co-produced psychological thriller film.\n- \"Mindscape\" was also known as \"Anna\".\n- \"Mindscape\" was the directorial feature film debut of Spanish filmmaker Jorge Dorado.\n- Jorge Dorado received a Goya Award nomination for \"Mindscape\".",
